OL,3,AFifth Canadian soldier dies from
OL,4,Ainjuries caused by large fire at
OL,5,Amilitary base
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Mark Carney wrote on X:
OL,8,F"Canadians are holding Private Dal
OL,9,FBianco's loved ones, and all those
OL,10,Fstill grieving in the wake of this
OL,11,Fterrible tragedy, in our hearts."
